 all ten band gains in one store update; moving a slider switches the selection
 back to Custom, exactly like the Windows panel.
 
+The control panel also keeps a system tray icon, like the Windows app: closing
+the window hides it to the tray while the audio service keeps running, the
+tray menu reopens the panel or quits the app, and login autostart runs hidden
+in the tray. Qt's tray speaks the XEmbed protocol, so on Plasma Wayland the
+panel restarts itself once under XWayland, where `xembed-sni-proxy` bridges
+the icon into the tray; `NAHIMIC_TRAY=0` restores the plain no-tray behaviour.
+
